# Project Scaffold — Structure, Tooling, Docker & CI

> Split from the former `python-production-standards.mdc` (v10.0 rules restructure).
> Corrected against **Correction 13** (uv + `uv sync --frozen`) and **Correction 14**
> (ADR / C4 / Structurizr artifacts in the tree).
> Synced to **Correction 28** (Python 3.14 floor, standard GIL build) and **Correction 42**
> (dual harness: OpenCode writer + Claude Code read-only reviewer) — see CORRECTION 45.
> Lockfile flags corrected Oct 2026: `--locked` is the staleness check (CI, final Docker
> sync); `--frozen` skips it (Docker dependency layer only). See 📦 and 🐳 below.

